WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.018
Oliver's class had a pet rat.

2
00:00:07.019 --> 00:00:11.362
The kids took turns taking the rat home.

3
00:00:11.363 --> 00:00:15.465
It was Oliver's turn.

4
00:00:15.466 --> 00:00:20.760
Oliver brought the cage home.

5
00:00:20.761 --> 00:00:25.487
He took the rat out.

6
00:00:25.488 --> 00:00:28.821
"Eek!" said Emmy.

7
00:00:28.822 --> 00:00:34.644
"That rat looks scary."

8
00:00:34.645 --> 00:00:38.065
"Ratty is nice," said Oliver.

9
00:00:38.066 --> 00:00:42.843
Ratty sat on Oliver's shoulder.

10
00:00:42.844 --> 00:00:48.375
"Rats are dirty," said Mom.

11
00:00:48.376 --> 00:00:52.648
"Ratty is clean," said Oliver.

12
00:00:52.649 --> 00:01:01.446
Ratty washed his face with his paw.

13
00:01:01.447 --> 00:01:04.877
"Rats are ugly," said Harry.

14
00:01:04.878 --> 00:01:08.184
"Ratty is cute," said Oliver.

15
00:01:08.185 --> 00:01:13.453
Ratty wiggled his nose.

16
00:01:13.454 --> 00:01:17.848
"Rats are smart," said Dad.

17
00:01:17.849 --> 00:01:21.695
"Let's build a place for Ratty to play.

18
00:01:21.696 --> 00:01:25.782
Everyone can help."

19
00:01:25.783 --> 00:01:30.213
"Not me," said Mom.

20
00:01:30.214 --> 00:01:34.967
"No way," said Harry.

21
00:01:34.968 --> 00:01:41.022
"No thanks!" said Emmy.

22
00:01:41.023 --> 00:01:46.227
Oliver got his blocks.

23
00:01:46.228 --> 00:01:52.001
Dad and Oliver built a castle.

24
00:01:52.002 --> 00:01:55.573
Oliver put Ratty near the castle.

25
00:01:55.574 --> 00:01:59.372
Ratty ran in the door.

26
00:01:59.373 --> 00:02:04.485
"He's climbing up the steps!" said Harry.

27
00:02:04.486 --> 00:02:11.822
"He's climbing out a window!" said Emmy.

28
00:02:11.823 --> 00:02:14.823
"Ratty is smart," said Harry.

29
00:02:14.824 --> 00:02:20.788
"Yes," said Emmy. "He's really smart!"

30
00:02:20.789 --> 00:02:25.549
Ratty stood on his back legs.

31
00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:31.650
"Ratty is hungry now," said Oliver.

32
00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:34.518
Ratty wiggled his nose.

33
00:02:34.519 --> 00:02:38.982
"Aw. He looks so cute," said Emmy.

34
00:02:38.983 --> 00:02:43.305
"See Ratty, Mom?"

35
00:02:43.306 --> 00:02:49.152
"I think Mom ran away from Ratty," said Dad.

36
00:02:49.153 --> 00:02:54.180
"Here I come," called Mom.

37
00:02:54.181 --> 00:03:09.556
"I got that cute rat some peanuts!"

